---
/* Design philosophy: policy content uses the same archival stage system, prioritizing calm reading and direct navigation over modal interruptions. */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import StageRail from '../components/StageRail.astro';
import { withSiteName } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title={withSiteName('Terms of Use')} description="Ketentuan Layanan Museum Wayang Guide." pathname="/terms/">
  <SiteHeader />
  <StageRail kind="document" />
  <main class="policy-page"><p class="eyebrow">DOCUMENT / 02</p><h1><span data-lang-content="id">Ketentuan Layanan</span><span data-lang-content="en">Terms of Use</span></h1><p class="policy-date"><span data-lang-content="id">Terakhir diperbarui: Agustus 2026</span><span data-lang-content="en">Last updated: August 2026</span></p>
    <section><h2><span data-lang-content="id">Penggunaan situs</span><span data-lang-content="en">Using this site</span></h2><p data-lang-content="id">Dengan mengakses dan menggunakan situs ini, Anda setuju pada ketentuan ini. Situs ini adalah panduan informasi pihak ketiga yang independen dan bukan layanan pemesanan, operator wisata, atau saluran resmi museum.</p><p data-lang-content="en">By accessing and using this site, you agree to these terms. It is an independent third-party information guide, not a booking service, tour operator, or official museum channel.</p></section>
    <section><h2><span data-lang-content="id">Penggunaan konten</span><span data-lang-content="en">Content use</span></h2><p data-lang-content="id">Konten tersedia untuk informasi umum. Desain dan konten asli dilindungi hak cipta. Foto dari Wikimedia Commons digunakan sesuai lisensi yang dicantumkan; Google Maps digunakan sesuai ketentuan layanan Google.</p><p data-lang-content="en">Content is provided for general information. Original design and content are protected by copyright. Wikimedia Commons photos are used under their stated licences; Google Maps is used under Google’s terms of service.</p></section>
    <section><h2><span data-lang-content="id">Ketepatan informasi</span><span data-lang-content="en">Information accuracy</span></h2><p data-lang-content="id">Kami berupaya menyajikan informasi yang cermat, namun tidak menjamin kelengkapan atau ketepatannya. Jadwal, tarif, kondisi, dan layanan dapat berubah. Verifikasi informasi penting melalui kanal resmi sebelum melakukan perjalanan.</p><p data-lang-content="en">We aim to provide careful information but do not guarantee completeness or accuracy. Hours, fees, conditions, and services may change. Verify important details through official channels before travelling.</p></section>
    <section><h2><span data-lang-content="id">Batas tanggung jawab</span><span data-lang-content="en">Limitation of liability</span></h2><p data-lang-content="id">Situs disediakan apa adanya tanpa jaminan. Kami tidak bertanggung jawab atas kerugian yang timbul dari penggunaan informasi ini, termasuk keputusan perjalanan yang dibuat berdasarkan informasi di situs.</p><p data-lang-content="en">This site is provided as is without warranties. We are not liable for losses arising from use of this information, including travel decisions made from it.</p></section>
  </main><SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
